            "value" : "%1$lld Anmeldung(en) verwendeten einfache http://-Adressen und wurden für https:// gespeichert (Zeilen %2$@); LocalGateKeys füllt Passwörter nur über HTTPS aus."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld login(s) used plain http:// addresses and were saved for https:// (rows %2$@); LocalGateKeys only fills passwords over HTTPS."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld inicio(s) de sesión usaban direcciones http:// simples y se guardaron para https:// (filas %2$@); LocalGateKeys solo rellena contraseñas por HTTPS."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld accessi usavano indirizzi http:// semplici e sono stati salvati per https:// (righe %2$@); LocalGateKeys compila le password solo su HTTPS."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld件のログインが通常のhttp://アドレスを使用していたため、https://用に保存しました(行 %2$@)。LocalGateKeysは、HTTPSでのみパスワードを自動入力します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "로그인 %1$lld개가 일반 http:// 주소를 사용하여 https://용으로 저장되었습니다(행 %2$@). LocalGateKeys는 HTTPS를 통해서만 비밀번호를 채웁니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld login(s) gebruikten gewone http://-adressen en zijn bewaard voor https:// (rijen %2$@); LocalGateKeys vult wachtwoorden alleen in via HTTPS."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loginy używające zwykłych adresów http:// (%1$lld) zapisano dla https:// (wiersze %2$@); LocalGateKeys uzupełnia hasła tylko przez HTTPS."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld login(s) usavam endereços http:// simples e foram salvos para https:// (linhas %2$@); o LocalGateKeys só preenche senhas por HTTPS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有 %1$lld 个登录使用了纯 http:// 地址，已改为保存为 https://（第 %2$@ 行）；LocalGateKeys 只会通过 HTTPS 填充密码。"
          }
        }
      }
